{"seq":3,"slug":"unicode-and-internationalization","title":"Unicode 与国际化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/regex-text-processing/advanced-patterns/unicode-and-internationalization","wordCount":1077,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"unicode-与国际化\">Unicode 与国际化</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>处理多语言文本时，正则必须正确理解 Unicode：JavaScript 字符串基于 UTF-16，非 BMP 字符（emoji、部分 CJK）需要<strong>代理对</strong>表示，因此匹配单位是码点而非码元。<code>u</code> 标志启用完整 Unicode 语义，<code>\\p{...}</code> 按属性匹配字符，<code>v</code> 标志进一步引入集合运算。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>码点 vs 码元：<code>u</code> 标志让 <code>.</code>、量词与字符类范围都按完整码点处理。</li>\n<li>属性转义 <code>\\p{Letter}</code>（通用类别）、<code>\\p{Script=Han}</code>（脚本）、<code>\\p{Emoji}</code>（二进制属性）用于替代硬编码的字符范围。</li>\n<li>匹配前对文本与模式统一做 NFC 规范化，避免等价字符因编码不同而匹配失败。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"unicode-基础与正则表达式\">Unicode 基础与正则表达式</h2><p>现代应用需要处理多语言文本，正则表达式必须正确理解 Unicode 字符。JavaScript 的字符串基于 UTF-16 编码，某些字符（如 emoji 和部分 CJK 扩展字符）需要两个码元（代理对）表示。</p>\n<h3 id=\"代码示例\">代码示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const emoji = &#39;😀&#39;;&#10;emoji.length;&#10;/^.$/u.test(emoji);&#10;/^.$/.test(emoji);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> emoji</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '😀'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">emoji.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(emoji);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(emoji);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"速查表\">速查表</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>码点</td>\n<td>Unicode 字符的唯一编号</td>\n<td>U+1F600 (😀)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>码元</td>\n<td>UTF-16 编码单元（16 位）</td>\n<td>0xD83D + 0xDE00</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BMP</td>\n<td>基本多语言平面 (U+0000–U+FFFF)</td>\n<td>大部分常用字符</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代理对</td>\n<td>BMP 之外字符的双码元编码</td>\n<td>emoji、古文字</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"图示\">图示</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    UNICODE[&quot;Unicode 字符&quot;] --&gt; BMP[&quot;BMP 字符&lt;br/&gt;U+0000 - U+FFFF&quot;]&#10;    UNICODE --&gt; SUPP[&quot;补充平面字符&lt;br/&gt;U+10000 - U+10FFFF&quot;]&#10;    BMP --&gt; SINGLE[&quot;单个码元&lt;br/&gt;length = 1&quot;]&#10;    SUPP --&gt; PAIR[&quot;代理对&lt;br/&gt;length = 2&quot;]&#10;    PAIR --&gt; HIGH[&quot;高代理&lt;br/&gt;0xD800-0xDBFF&quot;]&#10;    PAIR --&gt; LOW[&quot;低代理&lt;br/&gt;0xDC00-0xDFFF&quot;]\">graph TD\n    UNICODE[\"Unicode 字符\"] --&gt; BMP[\"BMP 字符&lt;br/&gt;U+0000 - U+FFFF\"]\n    UNICODE --&gt; SUPP[\"补充平面字符&lt;br/&gt;U+10000 - U+10FFFF\"]\n    BMP --&gt; SINGLE[\"单个码元&lt;br/&gt;length = 1\"]\n    SUPP --&gt; PAIR[\"代理对&lt;br/&gt;length = 2\"]\n    PAIR --&gt; HIGH[\"高代理&lt;br/&gt;0xD800-0xDBFF\"]\n    PAIR --&gt; LOW[\"低代理&lt;br/&gt;0xDC00-0xDFFF\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"u-标志与-unicode-模式\">u 标志与 Unicode 模式</h2><p>JavaScript 的 <code>u</code>（unicode）标志启用完整的 Unicode 支持，改变了多项正则行为。</p>\n<h3 id=\"代码示例\">代码示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"/^.$/u.test(&#39;😀&#39;);&#10;/^.$/.test(&#39;😀&#39;);&#10;&#10;/\\u{1F600}/u.test(&#39;😀&#39;);&#10;&#10;/^\\d$/u.test(&#39;٣&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'😀'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'😀'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\u</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">{1F600}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'😀'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'٣'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>u</code> 标志的影响：</p>\n<h3 id=\"速查表\">速查表</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>行为</th>\n<th>无 u 标志</th>\n<th>有 u 标志</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>.</code> 匹配</td>\n<td>单个码元</td>\n<td>完整码点（含代理对）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>\\u{XXXX}</code></td>\n<td>语法错误</td>\n<td>Unicode 码点转义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>量词作用对象</td>\n<td>单个码元</td>\n<td>完整码点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无效转义</td>\n<td>静默忽略</td>\n<td>抛出 SyntaxError</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字符类范围</td>\n<td>基于码元</td>\n<td>基于码点</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const withU = /[😀-😏]/u;&#10;withU.test(&#39;😃&#39;);&#10;withU.test(&#39;A&#39;);&#10;&#10;const chineseChar = /\\p{Script=Han}/u;&#10;chineseChar.test(&#39;中&#39;);&#10;chineseChar.test(&#39;A&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> withU</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">[😀-😏]</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">withU.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'😃'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">withU.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'A'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> chineseChar</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\p</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">{Script=Han}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">chineseChar.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'中'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">chineseChar.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'A'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><ul>\n<li><strong>提示：</strong> 始终在处理可能包含非 ASCII 字符的文本时使用 <code>u</code> 标志。没有 <code>u</code> 标志，正则引擎按码元而非码点处理字符，会导致 emoji 和部分 CJK 字符匹配异常。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"unicode-属性转义\">Unicode 属性转义</h2><p>ES2018 引入了 <code>\\p{...}</code> 和 <code>\\P{...}</code> 语法（需配合 <code>u</code> 标志），可以按 Unicode 属性匹配字符。</p>\n<h3 id=\"代码示例\">代码示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const letter = /\\p{Letter}/gu;&#10;&#39;Hello 你好 مرحبا&#39;.match(letter);&#10;&#10;const number = /\\p{Number}/gu;&#10;&#39;abc 123 ٤٥٦&#39;.match(number);&#10;&#10;const punct = /\\p{Punctuation}/gu;&#10;&#39;Hello, World! 你好！&#39;.match(punct);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> letter</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\p</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">{Letter}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">gu</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Hello 你好 مرحبا'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">match</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(letter);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\p</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">{Number}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">gu</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'abc 123 ٤٥٦'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">match</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(number);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> punct</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\p</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">{Punctuation}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">gu</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Hello, World! 你好！'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">match</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(punct);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>常用 Unicode 属性类别：</p>\n<h3 id=\"速查表\">速查表</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性</th>\n<th>缩写</th>\n<th>匹配内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>Letter</code></td>\n<td><code>L</code></td>\n<td>所有语言的字母</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Number</code></td>\n<td><code>N</code></td>\n<td>所有数字字符</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Punctuation</code></td>\n<td><code>P</code></td>\n<td>标点符号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Symbol</code></td>\n<td><code>S</code></td>\n<td>符号（数学、货币等）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Separator</code></td>\n<td><code>Z</code></td>\n<td>空白和分隔符</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Mark</code></td>\n<td><code>M</code></td>\n<td>组合标记</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"图示\">图示</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    PROP[&quot;Unicode 属性&quot;] --&gt; GENERAL[&quot;通用类别&lt;br/&gt;\\p#lbrace;Letter#rbrace;&quot;]&#10;    PROP --&gt; SCRIPT[&quot;脚本&lt;br/&gt;\\p#lbrace;Script=Han#rbrace;&quot;]&#10;    PROP --&gt; BINARY[&quot;二进制属性&lt;br/&gt;\\p#lbrace;Emoji#rbrace;&quot;]&#10;    GENERAL --&gt; L[&quot;L 字母&quot;]&#10;    GENERAL --&gt; N[&quot;N 数字&quot;]&#10;    GENERAL --&gt; P[&quot;P 标点&quot;]&#10;    SCRIPT --&gt; HAN[&quot;Han 汉字&quot;]&#10;    SCRIPT --&gt; LATIN[&quot;Latin 拉丁&quot;]&#10;    SCRIPT --&gt; ARABIC[&quot;Arabic 阿拉伯&quot;]\">graph LR\n    PROP[\"Unicode 属性\"] --&gt; GENERAL[\"通用类别&lt;br/&gt;\\p#lbrace;Letter#rbrace;\"]\n    PROP --&gt; SCRIPT[\"脚本&lt;br/&gt;\\p#lbrace;Script=Han#rbrace;\"]\n    PROP --&gt; BINARY[\"二进制属性&lt;br/&gt;\\p#lbrace;Emoji#rbrace;\"]\n    GENERAL --&gt; L[\"L 字母\"]\n    GENERAL --&gt; N[\"N 数字\"]\n    GENERAL --&gt; P[\"P 标点\"]\n    SCRIPT --&gt; HAN[\"Han 汉字\"]\n    SCRIPT --&gt; LATIN[\"Latin 拉丁\"]\n    SCRIPT --&gt; ARABIC[\"Arabic 阿拉伯\"]</pre><p>按脚本（Script）匹配特定语言的字符：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const han = /\\p{Script=Han}+/gu;&#10;&#39;Hello 世界 123&#39;.match(han);&#10;&#10;const hiragana = /\\p{Script=Hiragana}+/gu;&#10;&#39;こんにちは世界&#39;.match(hiragana);&#10;&#10;const latin = /\\p{Script=Latin}+/gu;&#10;&#39;Hello 世界&#39;.match(latin);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> han</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\p</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">{Script=Han}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">gu</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Hello 世界 123'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--